h as quitting smoking.\n\nPlease feel free to reach out if you need any further information or if there are any specific concerns you would like to discuss.\n\nThank you for referring Kathy for this consultation.\n\nBest regards,\n\nDr. Patty Mills \nFamily Medicine Specialist \nVazquez PLC Clinic\n\n---\n\nThis letter provides a comprehensive overview of Kathy Mitchell’s current medical status, incorporating all necessary details and adhering to the provided data and guidelines.\n"
